WEBVTT

00:05:29.492 --> 00:05:32.078
is a story that my grandmother,
Yunita, told me.

00:05:32.703 --> 00:05:36.123
A long time ago,
before the sugarcane farms,

00:05:36.123 --> 00:05:39.627
before the grass-thatched huts
and the round compounds,

00:05:39.668 --> 00:05:42.880
the animals lived happily
because there was plenty in the land

00:05:42.922 --> 00:05:44.799
and a future to look forward to.

00:05:45.925 --> 00:05:47.843
But farming threatened the land,

00:05:47.885 --> 00:05:50.096
and the future was all of a sudden bleak.

00:05:50.763 --> 00:05:52.765
And so the lion roared.

00:05:53.432 --> 00:05:55.309
But there was no water.

00:05:55.351 --> 00:05:57.019
And the elephant grunted.

00:05:57.478 --> 00:05:58.938
But there was no water.

00:05:59.563 --> 00:06:01.524
And the cheetah yelped,